00&h=200&blur=200&s=607a7ac6ca178b25dabb336149806325 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really fell in love with your style! I'd like to request an illustration of two duke's daughters who have promised each other a fairytale romance that lasts forever.\n\n🌷 MEADOW (164 cm) Wild, playful, and flirtatious. She indulges in all the world has to offer, and will even consume poison if it's sweet. She likes to develop crushes on others and believes she was naturally born to be loved.\n\n※ Please notice her freckles and her tulip-like eyes.\n\nThemes: Semper Augustus tulip, meadows, wildflowers, rabbits, ribbons, tiramisu, poisoned apple, tea party, Cheshire Cat, Marie Antoinette\n\n🌾 NALISS (173 cm)\nNaive, sheltered, and emotionally volatile. She knows only the sweet things in life and wants a painless love. She will hurt others if that means she gets to keep them forever.\n\n※ No eye highlight and heart-shaped pupils.\n\nThemes: wheat fields, Fields of Asphodel, knives & daggers, glass shards, Rapunzel, bookshelves, death\n\nPlease draw freely! Alternative clothing OK!\n\nhttps://zippy-stealer-c43.notion.site/Meadow-Naliss-1d217861336c806c9820f27ff471bf28", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@abcdyubo/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0beeaca0/uploads/origins/e9a36236-af14-4560-a7b0-56e12ff6b7c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=16552dbdbb03eb8c9148c54164939fa2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0beeaca0/uploads/origins/e9a36236-af14-4560-a7b0-56e12ff6b7c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=16552dbdbb03eb8c9148c54164939fa2, https://si.imgix.net/0beeaca0/uploads/origins/e9a36236-af14-4560-a7b0-56e12ff6b7c3?bg=%23fff&auto=